# =====================================================================
#  .gitignore  -  Raspberry Pi Embedded Linux (C) + STM32 Firmware
# =====================================================================
#  NOTE: Source files (*.c / *.h) are NEVER ignored in this repo.
#  NOTE: Executables built WITHOUT an extension (e.g. eth_init) cannot be
#        matched by a pattern, so they must be listed by exact name.
#        Add one line per binary at the bottom of this file.
# =====================================================================

